Cardmaniacs 1.0 is here! The first public release brings RSS feeds, Read Later, and Bookmarks together in one native Apple app.

## Highlights

- **RSS & Atom feeds** with full-text parsing and card-based layout
- **Read Later** with quick capture from any app via share extension
- **Bookmarks** with tags, smart folders, and full-text search
- **Offline reading** for articles and documents
- **iCloud Sync** across all your Apple devices
- **Vim-style keyboard navigation** for power users
